-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",259,{
[8257]="7000AF2E\n1\tTalk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig\tGlân Vraig lay far to east and south of Lugazag. After taking Lugazag away from the Enemy, the army of the Free Peoples have sent you to Glân Vraig to request reinforcements for the tower.\n",
[8258]="70061F5A\n1\tTalk to Rhiangar to hear her tale of Luilloth\tRhiangar Nevit has asked you to listen to her tale of Luilloth. Rhiangar can be found in Crossway House, the inn of Herne.\n2\tMeet Rhiangar Nevit near Dol Ernil\tRhiangar Nevit has asked you to meet her near Dol Ernil. Dol Ernil is in north-western Cardolan.\n3\tSearch for the statue of Luilloth\tRhiangar Nevit has asked you to find a statue of Luilloth in Dol Ernil and to examine its base for clues. The statue of Luilloth is in Dol Ernil.\n4\tBring the scroll to Rhiangar\tUpon examining the statue of Luilloth you discovered an ancient scroll! You should bring the scroll to Rhiangar. Rhiangar is by the roadside, near Dol Ernil.\n",
[8259]="7000F025\n1\tBring the luistin to Juha\030Collect a Lossoth luistin\tJuha is at Sûri-kylä and Pynti-peldot in Forochel. Juha has asked you to keep a wary eye open for any of the luistin the Lossoth may have lost during their travels through the frozen wastes and bring them to him.\n",
[8260]="70066583\n1\tCollect scattered lumber (total: 6)\tCamaen has asked you to collect the scattered lumber around Parth Rest.\n2\tPlace the lumber in its proper place\tThe lumber should be placed in its proper place by Camean in Parth Rest.\n3\tTalk to Camaen in Parth Rest\tYou have collected as much lumber as you can and returned it all to its proper place. You should report your success to Camaen. Camaen can be found in Parth Rest.\n",
[8261]="70066589\n1\tTalk to Raithir in Ethring\tHerion has asked you to investigate the missing lumber supplies from Ethring. Ethring can be found in Ringlo Vale to the north.\n2\tTalk to Dervorin in Ethring\tRaithir has told you that Dervorin should be able to help as Lord of the Vale. Dervorin can be found in Ethring.\n",
[8262]="70059770\n1\tCollect cuts of lumber from the Wildwood (total: 10)\tTrees for harvesting lumber can be found in the Wildwood. You should collect cuts of lumber.\n2\tPlace the cuts of lumber in a storage crate\tA storage crate can be found in either Trader's Wharf or Trestlebridge. You should place the cuts of lumber in a storage crate.\n",
[8263]="7002D507\n1\tCollect luminous goop (total: 15)\t\n2\tBring the luminous goop to Sori\tSori can be found in the southern passage of the Silvertine Lodes. You should return to Sori with the luminous goop you collected from the many glow-worms.\n",
[8264]="7001A63F\n1\tCollect luminous stingers (total: 8)\tFireflies can be found throughout the Drownholt in Mirkwood. Rocheledh has asked you to collect the venomous stingers of fireflies so that he may craft an antidote against the poison. He fears for safety of the Elf-friends who travel with the Malledhrim.\n2\tBring the luminous stingers to Rocheledh at Estolad Mernael\tRocheledh is at Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt. You should bring the stingers you collected to Rocheledh so that he may craft a useful antidote from their luminous venom.\n",
[8265]="70057812\n1\tDefeat Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog\tWithin the encampment of Lumrog, Orcs and hobgoblins serve foul hill-trolls that make this place home. If these creatures are dispatched, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.\n2\tDefeat Orcs or hobgoblins in Lumrog (total: 8)\tThe encampment of Lumrog echoes not only with the heavy footfalls of hill-trolls, but also with the shrieks and cries of their servants and allies. If these Orcs and hobgoblins are slain, the trolls will find it difficult to maintain their presence in Misthallow.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[8266]="70057810\n1\tDefeat hill-trolls in Lumrog\tThe sound of heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around an encampment of Lumrog. Hill-trolls have settled here and they pose a danger to those in the area.\n2\tDefeat hill-trolls in Lumrog (total: 6)\tLumrog has long been a home to a group of hill-trolls in Misthallow. The sound of their heavy footsteps shakes the rocks around their encampment striking fear into the hearts of the nearby residents.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[8267]="700196B5\n1\tDefeat merrevail in Lumul-nar (total: 10)\030Defeat bats in Lumul-nar (total: 15)\tLumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads. Frár has asked you to clear the Lumul-nar of bats and merrevail to make the place more suitable for the dwarves to take over.\n2\tTalk to Frár\tFrár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar. You should speak with Frár of your defeat of the many bat-creatures in the Hall of Mirrors.\n",
[8268]="700196B3\n1\tDefeat the evil presence in the Hall of Mirrors\tThe Hall of Mirrors can be found in Zirakzigil, to the north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads. Frár has asked you to defeat the menace that holds the Hall of Mirrors in its clutches. You should bring a friend or two on this dangerous venture.\n2\tTalk to Frár\tFrár is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, to the south of Lumul-nar. You should speak with Frár and inform him of your success against Ergoth in the Hall of Mirrors.\n",
[8269]="700196B4\n1\tCollect relics of interest (total: 10)\tLumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors, can be found north of the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in Zirakzigil in Durin's Way. You should venture to Zirakzigil and search among the creatures there for any relics of Durin's time.\n2\tBring the lesser rings to Frár\tFrár awaits your return in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, south of Lumul-nar. You should give Frár the many rings you collected from the foul creatures of the Hall of Mirrors.\n",
[8270]="70061F24\n1\tDeliver food and drink to Deris\030Deliver food and drink to Eryl\030Deliver food and drink to Lhian and Cledd\030Deliver food and drink to Gwion\tDeliver food to the watch-towers along Mossward's defensive wall.\n2\tTalk to Rhedyn\tYou should tell Rhedyn that you have completed your deliveries. Talk to Rhedyn.\n",
[8271]="70072BF9\n1\tExamine the pods of the blight in Adagím\tPods of the blight draw your attention in the woods of Adagím.\n2\tDefeat fen-lurkers in Adagím (total: 4)\030Defeat rats in Adagím (total: 4)\tIt is possible that fen-lurkers and rats help spread the Pale Blight throughout Adagím.\n3\tCompleted\tYou defeated fen-lurkers and rats in Adagím, hoping to slow the spread of the Pale Blight.\n",
[8272]="7006617D\n1\tDefeat bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann\tYou should clear some bog-lurkers out of Makham Mijann to make their numbers more manageable. Makham Mijann is located to the north of Tadrent.\n2\tDefeat bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann (total: 10)\tYou should clear some bog-lurkers out of Makham Mijann to make their numbers more manageable. Makham Mijann is located to the north of Tadrent.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many bog-lurkers at Makham Mijann.\n",
[8273]="70048C97\n1\tDefeat bloody bog-lurkers (total: 10)\tBloody bog-lurkers can be found in the red waters of Agarnaith. You should defeat bloody bog-lurkers.\n2\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be found in his hideout. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[8274]="7003997D\n1\tDefeat Ravening Wargs (total: 8)\tWargs can be found to the south of Middlemead in northern Kingstead. You have encountered Wargs of the White Hand on the plains of Kingstead. You should defeat them to keep their jaws from the people of Middlemead.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have slain a great many Wargs on the fields of Kingstead.\n",
[8275]="700529D8\n1\tDefeat goblin looters (total: 7)\tGoblin looters can be found stealthily skulking near Ainhard's homestead. You should defeat goblin looters.\n2\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n",
[8276]="700682DA\n1\tDefeat bog-lurkers in Basha Ghând (total: 6)\tErothai has asked you to clean up the bogs to the north so that Mâr Naphra maintains such a high status as an establishment.\n2\tTalk to Erothai\tYou've done all you can to clear the bogs. You should talk to Erothai and give your full report. Erothai can be found in Mâr Naphra.\n",
[8277]="700494CF\n1\tDefeat worms (total: 8)\030Defeat salamanders (total: 8)\tWorms and salamanders can be found in Talath Úrui, mainly near the Ghâshghurm. You should defeat any worms and salamanders that you encounter.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many worms and salamanders in Talath Úrui.\n",
[8278]="7001674B\n1\tDefeat Nameless in the Foundations of Stone (total: 6)\tNameless can be found throughout the Foundations of Stone, especially along the lake's eastern edge. Nökkvi wishes you to dispose of the nameless horrors that have been terrifying him\n2\tTalk to Nökkvi at the Shadowed Refuge\tNökkvi is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. You should return to Nökkvi and assure him that you have slain the nameless beasts.\n",
[8279]="7001521B\n1\tDefeat Orcs in The Chamber of Dark Waters (total: 10)\tOrcs may be found in The Chamber of Dark Waters to the south of the Rotting Cellar. Sylfa has asked you to make a pre-emptive attack against the Orcs while his fellows advance to the west.\n2\tTalk to Ansurr in Hulwul-nefekh\tAnsurr is in Hulwul-nefekh, west of The Chamber of Dark Waters. You observed that the Orcs you defeated were different than those you had seen throughout Moria, with odd growths covering them. Ansurr should be made aware of this.\n",
[8280]="70007D9A\n1\tBring the lynx-hide to an Elven armoursmith to craft a cloak\tElves dwell in the hidden valley of Rivendell in the eastern reaches of the Trollshaws. Attacked by a lynx of the High Moor, you bested the beast and discovered that your blow left nary a mark upon its hide. Having skilfully removed the hide, you should seek an Elven armoursmith that could fit it into a magnificent cloak.\n",
[8281]="70042EC6\n1\tCollect Half-troll axes at Lân Mefam\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should collect Half-troll axes by defeating Half-trolls in Lân Mefam.\n2\tCollect Half-troll axes (total: 5)\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should collect Half-troll axes by defeating Half-trolls in Lân Mefam.\n3\tBring the Half-troll axes to Anborn\tAnborn can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. Show Anborn the Half-troll axes you collected.\n",
[8282]="70042EC5\n1\tBurn Haradrim tents at Lân Mefam\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should destroy Haradrim tents at Lân Mefam.\n2\tBurn Haradrim tents (total: 10)\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should destroy Haradrim tents at Lân Mefam.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed Haradrim tents.\n",
[8283]="70042EC4\n1\tDefeat Haradrim Marksmen at Lân Mefam\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Haradrim Marksmen at Lân Mefam.\n2\tDefeat Haradrim Marksmen at Lân Mefam (total: 6)\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Haradrim Marksmen at Lân Mefam.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Haradrim Marksmen.\n",
[8284]="70042EC3\n1\tDestroy Mûmak feed sacks at Lân Mefam\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should destroy Mûmak feed bags at Lân Mefam. Destroying them should make the Mûmakil hungry, restless, and difficult to control.\n2\tDestroy Mûmak feed sacks (total: 12)\tLân Mefam is located east of Bâr Húrin. You should destroy Mûmak feed bags at Lân Mefam. Destroying them should make the Mûmakil hungry, restless, and difficult to control.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed Mûmak feed bags.\n",
[8285]="700375CE\n1\tSpeak with Burnoth to return Léofdag's body to Fleda in Aldburg\tLéofdag's wife, Fleda, is in Aldburg. Burnoth asked you to return Léofdag's body to his wife, Fleda, and tell the people of Aldburg of his valour and honour in the Battle of the Hornburg.\n2\tTalk to Fleda\tFleda is in Aldburg. Now that the memorial for Léofdag has ended, you should speak with Fleda.\n",
[8286]="70015469\n1\tHelp Fostólf\030Help Gansi\030Help Rink\tFostólf, Rink, and Gansi are in the Chamber of the Cross-roads. Líkmund suggested that you speak with Fostólf, Rink, and Gansi and learn what tasks they might have for you.\n2\tTalk to Líkmund at the Chamber of the Cross-roads\tLíkmund is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads. You should return to Líkmund and tell him of your efforts on behalf of Fostólf, Rink, and Gansi.\n",
[8287]="70050215\n1\tDefeat Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu\tLúbtul poses a grave threat to all that seek the knowledge buried within Thikil-gundu.\n2\tDefeat Lúbtul, Scourge of Thikil-gundu\tLúbtul poses a grave threat to all that seek the knowledge buried within Thikil-gundu.\n3\tCompleted\tLúbtul poses a grave threat to all that seek the knowledge buried within Thikil-gundu.\n",
[8288]="70008516\n1\tTalk to Machan when you are ready\tHelp Machan to get out of the fire-worm lair.\n2\tTalk to Murdaigán\tTell Murdaigán that Machan is safe.\n",
})
